{"id":18922,"date":"2025-10-24T19:39:36","date_gmt":"2025-10-24T19:39:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/?page_id=18922"},"modified":"2025-10-27T16:06:28","modified_gmt":"2025-10-27T16:06:28","slug":"dj-joe-l","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/dj-joe-l\/","title":{"rendered":"DJ Joe L."},"content":{"rendered":"<p><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-18924\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/IMG_9629-683x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"A man with long brown hair and a beard sits on a wooden chair outdoors, wearing a dark sweater and jeans, with hands clasped in his lap.\" width=\"302\" height=\"453\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/IMG_9629-683x1024.jpeg 683w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/IMG_9629-200x300.jpeg 200w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/IMG_9629-768x1152.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/IMG_9629-1024x1536.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/IMG_9629-1365x2048.jpeg 1365w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/IMG_9629-scaled.jpeg 1707w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 302px) 100vw, 302px\" \/>DJ Joe Lockwood<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Born and raised in Tampa, Florida, DJ Joe Lockwood has been bringing the beats and energy to dance floors since 2013! With over eight years of experience, Joe knows exactly how to keep the crowd moving and the good vibes flowing.<\/p>\n<p>From weddings and hip-hop showcases to all kinds of variety events, Joe\u2019s versatility and passion shine through every performance. His love for music started when he first picked up a Paul Oakenfold album, and he\u2019s been hooked ever since!<\/p>\n<p><strong>What Joe loves most about being a DJ:<\/strong><br \/>\n\u201cSeeing everyone dancing, smiling, and having the time of their lives and hearing all the thank-yous at the end of the night!\u201d<\/p>\n<p><strong>In Joe\u2019s headphones:<\/strong>\u00a0<em>SIDE2SIDE<\/em>\u00a0by Nikko (but he listens to just about everything).<br \/>\n<strong>Dance floor favorites:<\/strong>\u00a0\u201cOne More Time\u201d by Daft Punk, \u201cMUTT\u201d by Jun Tanaka, and \u201cB.O.B (Bombs Over Baghdad)\u201d by Outkast.<\/p>\n<p>When he\u2019s not behind the decks, Joe loves producing house and hip-hop music and spending time with his girlfriend, dog, and cat. No matter the event, DJ Joe Lockwood brings the music, the energy, and the fun leaving every crowd smiling and wanting more!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>DJ Joe Lockwood Born and raised in Tampa, Florida, DJ Joe Lockwood has been bringing the beats and energy to dance floors since 2013! With over eight years of experience, Joe knows exactly how to keep the crowd moving and the good vibes flowing. From weddings and hip-hop showcases to all kinds of variety events,&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-18922","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>DJ Joe L. - JAMMIN&#039; DJs Georgia &amp; Tennessee<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/dj-joe-l\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"DJ Joe L.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"DJ Joe Lockwood Born and raised in Tampa, Florida, DJ Joe Lockwood has been bringing the beats and energy to dance floors since 2